      "id": "claim_e301c132df9040f59fee1fac7815482c",
      "statement": "`FilesystemMiddleware` exposes the built-in `ls`, `read_file`, `write_file`, `edit_file`, `delete`, `glob`, `grep`, and `execute` tools according to its model-facing allowlist; explicit allowlists must contain `read_file`, while unsupported `delete` and `execute` are removed at model-request time.",
